# BookMyBarber Workspace Layout

This workspace is a **multi-repo monorepo folder**. Each app has its own git remote; do not rename these directories.

| Role | Directory | Stack | Git repo |
|------|-----------|-------|----------|
| **Backend API** | `BookMyBarber-bk/` | Node.js + Express + TypeScript | `BookMyBarber-bk` |
| **Admin dashboard** | `BookMyBarber-admin/` | React + Vite + TypeScript | `BookMyBarber-admin` |
| **Mobile app** | `BookMyBarber-App/` | React Native + Expo | `BookMyBarber-App` |

## Do not use

- `backend/` — deprecated; use `BookMyBarber-bk/`
- `admin-dashboard/` — deprecated; use `BookMyBarber-admin/`

## Architecture (see also `api-architecture.mdc`)

- **Clients → Backend → Supabase** only. No direct database/Supabase calls from `BookMyBarber-App` or `BookMyBarber-admin`.
- Clients use `src/lib/api.ts` + `src/lib/auth.ts` → `http://localhost:5000/v1`
- Backend uses **Supabase secret key only** (backend `.env`):
  - `SUPABASE_URL` + `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` → Postgres, storage
  - **Local JWT auth:** `JWT_ACCESS_SECRET`, `JWT_ACCESS_TTL`, `JWT_REFRESH_TTL_DAYS`
  - **OAuth login:** `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, `MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID` / `MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET`, `MICROSOFT_AUTH_REDIRECT_URI`
  - Legacy fallbacks: `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` for secret

## Environment variables

| App | Prefix | Required |
|-----|--------|----------|
| Backend | `PORT`, `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY`, `JWT_*`, `SAFEPAY_*` | Supabase DB + JWT + SafePay server-only |
| Mobile | `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID` | no Supabase keys |
| Admin | `VITE_API_URL` | no Supabase keys |

## Agent progress tracker

- **`docs/PROJECT_PROGRESS.md`** — features, bugs, API, changelog (read/update per `project-progress.mdc`)
- **`docs/code-quality.md`** — Fallow reports (read/update per `code-quality.mdc` + `documentation-updates.mdc` on **every** change)
- **`documentation-updates.mdc`** — mandatory doc refresh checklist (always apply)

## Boot commands (from workspace root)

```bash
cd BookMyBarber-bk && npm run dev
cd BookMyBarber-admin && npm run dev
cd BookMyBarber-App && npm start
```
